{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"発表になりましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネプチューン堀内健さんプロデュース舞台第4弾に出演させて頂くことになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャストの出川哲郎さんや伊藤修子さんなど毎年出演されてる方々のなか\n今回の4弾目にして私ははじめて参加させて頂きます！\nきっとたくさん出演者の皆様に頼ってしまうかもですが、\nこれでもかというくらいホリケンワールドに身を委ねて 成長してかえってきたいと思います＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個性豊かなこのメンツのなかで、\n能條の影薄かったなぁなんて言われないように！\n頑張るよっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・堀内夜あけの会「堀内健演劇講演会　未来のファンタジー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日程：\n2017年4月28日（金）～5月1日（月）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出演者：\n堀内健、出川哲朗、能條愛未（乃木坂46）、松浦司、伊藤修子　ほか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脚本：\n堀内健 村上大樹"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演出：\n村上大樹"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先行受付は明日24日のお昼12時から開始です！！\n皆様ぜひお早めに＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"劇場でお待ちしております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日発売\n月刊大人ザテレビジョンの表紙をのぎえいごメンバーと未央奈、まいちゅんとやらせていただいてますっ\n見てね〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日の幕張個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2017/01/24/8649213/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OUTRO SOL"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2017/01/24/8649213/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みつあみあみあみあみ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日の話題は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・能條牧場入らせて下さい←これほとんど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・武道館の気づいたら片思い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・今年の抱負"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・牛若丸げんき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・能條牧場での自分の役割（例: 俺、牛になるよ！！）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・モバメ突然多くなって逆に心配"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・乃木團もっとやって欲しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・いまあだ名つけて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての方が本当に多かった！！\n毎回思うけど、これだけメンバーがいるなかわざわざ能條のところに来てくれる方々 感謝しかない。。(＞＜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牧場主は幸せです❤笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2017/01/24/8649213/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2017/01/24/8649213/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に問題〜〜❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q. あみは、いま どのメンバーの家に泊まってるでしょうか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1. 高山一実"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2. 樋口日奈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3. 斎藤ちはる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4. 和田まあや"}],"source":"archive"}